WEBVTT

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:18.060
<i>Oh Yeah!
Be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>oozora kidou wo koero</i>

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>Pass the orbit beyond the sky</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>osaekirenai maenomeri na speed</i>

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:40.910
<i>Can't hold back this rushing speed</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>minareta machi ga diorama ni naru</i>

00:00:41.080 --> 00:00:45.920
<i>A familiar town turns into a diorama</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>futoumei na sora tsukinukerunda</i>

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Burst through the unclear skies</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>nayami toka fuman toka futtobashite</i>

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:56.300
<i>Blow away your worries and discontent</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>manual doori no tabi nanka irane</i>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:01:01.720
<i>Who needs a journey that's by the book</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>mayottemo furuetemo koudo agete</i>

00:01:01.890 --> 00:01:07.520
<i>Even if you're lost or trembling,
Raise the altitude</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
ikigatte shikujitte tachiagatte</i>

00:01:07.690 --> 00:01:12.530
<i>Oh Yeah!
Show off, mess up, stand back up</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>kimi to mitsumeru michi naru chiheisen</i>

00:01:12.690 --> 00:01:17.610
<i>The unknown horizon I watch with you</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>saa tsuyogatte tobinotte kaze ni natte</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:22.490
<i>Now, be strong, jump on, become the wind</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>asu wo terasu taiyou
mejirushi ni shitesa</i>

00:01:22.660 --> 00:01:28.290
<i>Use the sun
That lights tomorrow as a guide</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>tonde ike jiyuu na Glorious World</i>

00:01:28.460 --> 00:01:34.130
<i>Fly off to the Glorious World of freedom</i>

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:41.970
<i>The mysterious world where Digimon live,
the Digital World.</i>

00:01:42.850 --> 00:01:48.210
<i>Taichi and the Chosen Ones with their
partner Digimon continue their journey</i>

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:55.070
<i>to prevent the revival of the bringer
of destruction and darkness, Millenniumon.</i>

00:01:57.320 --> 00:02:02.180
<i>Hikari, who was kidnapped
by a mysterious enemy, Skullknightmon,</i>

00:02:02.180 --> 00:02:05.180
<i>turned out to be the last Chosen One.</i>

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:09.250
<i>Taichi learned this
and overcame fierce battles. And now...</i>

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:25.930
We sense it.

00:02:26.430 --> 00:02:27.600
We sense it.

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:29.450
We sense it.

00:02:29.450 --> 00:02:34.750
The will of Millenniumon who has come
from the distant Cloud Continent.

00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:37.610
The will of Millenniumon.

00:02:39.260 --> 00:02:42.090
Millenniumon's shards that sleep
within FAGA,

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:46.620
the depths of this Eternal Continent,
have also begun to beat.

00:02:47.200 --> 00:02:49.210
Begun to beat.

00:02:49.580 --> 00:02:55.060
Millenniumon desires the birth
of a worthy new body.

00:02:55.060 --> 00:02:59.880
Millenniumon desires a resurrection
as soon as possible.

00:03:00.510 --> 00:03:01.750
A resurrection.

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:03.150
A resurrection.

00:03:03.150 --> 00:03:04.850
A resurrection.

00:03:06.220 --> 00:03:08.480
Very well, then...

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:23.160
THE HIKARI OF DAWN

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:26.850
<i>The ISS is heading straight towards</i>

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:30.560
<i>the point where it'll collide
with artificial satellites.</i>

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:33.440
<i>The thruster of the docked Soyuz</i>

00:03:33.440 --> 00:03:37.020
<i>should be able to change its path
to avoid the collision.</i>

00:03:37.020 --> 00:03:41.380
<i>But there's probably a Digimon interfering
with the controls in the network.</i>

00:03:41.880 --> 00:03:44.090
<i>Just like the uncontrollable ships!</i>

00:03:44.590 --> 00:03:46.740
<i>We must solve this quickly.</i>

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:49.600
<i>But I can't find a solution for it yet.</i>

00:03:50.140 --> 00:03:51.080
Oh no!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:53.230
This is no time to be...

00:03:55.230 --> 00:03:57.040
taking a bath.

00:03:57.040 --> 00:04:00.150
Why? How in the world did
we end up this way?

00:04:01.190 --> 00:04:03.590
They must really like you, Joe.

00:04:03.590 --> 00:04:05.130
What do they like?!

00:04:05.130 --> 00:04:09.370
If we don't stop this, the junior high
I'm entering will be gone too!

00:04:11.830 --> 00:04:13.370
What's this?!

00:04:15.250 --> 00:04:16.750
What's going on?

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:18.590
Is this...

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:21.260
to celebrate?

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:23.900
I'll continue to investigate this.

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:26.740
Taichi-san, please look for Hikari-san.

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:29.660
<i>Yeah. Thanks, Koshiro.</i>

00:04:29.660 --> 00:04:32.040
<i>Is everything okay over there?</i>

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.870
Yes, we're in a safe zone now.

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:37.170
If I find something, I'll contact you.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:38.060
See you!

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:40.670
Now, let's resume investigating.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:44.550
Koshiro-san, are you sure
you don't want to take a break?

00:04:44.550 --> 00:04:45.760
I'm fine.

00:04:45.760 --> 00:04:50.330
Besides, this is about all I can do.

00:04:52.660 --> 00:04:56.390
Now, let's hurry and find Hikari!

00:04:56.390 --> 00:04:57.390
Yeah.

00:04:57.390 --> 00:05:00.130
Plus, the other Holy Digimon too--

00:05:02.170 --> 00:05:03.730
Oh, what's that?!

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:07.050
The black lightning is concentrated there?

00:05:07.760 --> 00:05:09.470
Something's coming this way!

00:05:10.180 --> 00:05:11.720
They're Kokuwamon!

00:05:11.470 --> 00:05:13.680
KOKUWAMON

00:05:12.810 --> 00:05:13.740
An attack?!

00:05:13.740 --> 00:05:15.770
No, something's strange!

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:18.500
They're not even looking at us.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.830
They're fleeing from something?

00:05:20.830 --> 00:05:22.030
We're almost out!

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:32.800
Black energy is accumulating.
What in the world is there?

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:34.290
Taichi, look!

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:40.130
That's...

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.670
Komondomon, please hurry!

00:05:57.940 --> 00:05:59.100
What is that?!

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.570
Hikari!

00:06:37.680 --> 00:06:39.730
A black crystal?

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:43.480
Isn't this... what we saw
in Lopmon's memory?

00:06:43.900 --> 00:06:47.990
<i>Millenniumon's shards
that rained down on this continent!</i>

00:07:00.920 --> 00:07:01.810
Hikari!

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:03.040
Taichi!

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:10.050
Hikari...

00:07:10.590 --> 00:07:12.300
Hikari!

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:17.810
Hikari!

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:20.560
I'm coming to save you right now!

00:07:23.150 --> 00:07:24.690
The time has come.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:30.460
The black crystals scattered
across the Eternal Continent,

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:33.590
shards of Millenniumon's body.

00:07:33.590 --> 00:07:37.180
The black lightning that strikes down
on the Eternal Continent,

00:07:37.180 --> 00:07:40.270
power leaked from the human world.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:45.960
The shards accumulate power
and that accumulation is sent to FAGA.

00:07:47.090 --> 00:07:49.190
Listen, Skullknightmon.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:51.860
Those shards create a contraption

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:57.260
that strengthens the connection
with FAGA in the distance.

00:07:57.850 --> 00:08:00.540
The altar to resurrect Millenniumon.

00:08:00.540 --> 00:08:04.690
Come, now is the time to fulfil your duty.

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:29.840
Skullknightmon,
the one Millenniumon selected.

00:08:30.300 --> 00:08:35.150
The last Chosen One,
the one Millenniumon desires.

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:39.850
You shall be summoned to darkness together
and when you both fall to it,

00:08:40.310 --> 00:08:42.660
you will become the sacrifices

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:46.150
for the great darkness's birth,
Millenniumon's resurrection.

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:50.110
Super Evolution.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:02.040
Darkknightmon.

00:09:06.040 --> 00:09:07.520
Taichi! Agumon!

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:09.350
What's happening?!

00:09:09.350 --> 00:09:12.570
Hikari is resonating with Darkknightmon

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:15.490
and a tremendous power
is about to be born.

00:09:15.490 --> 00:09:17.180
But why?

00:09:18.260 --> 00:09:21.260
Why is it Hikari and Darkknightmon?

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:22.870
Hikari?!

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:23.980
Taichi!

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:28.230
Let's go. Let's save Hikari together!

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:29.940
Agumon...

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:31.690
Yeah!

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:35.420
Agumon Evolution!

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.630
Greymon!

00:09:36.630 --> 00:09:38.620
Charge, Greymon!

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:49.400
We'll take this one!

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.460
Sora! Birdramon!

00:09:56.630 --> 00:09:57.970
Birdramon!

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:10.940
Undead Soldier.

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:21.200
Mega Flame!

00:10:26.160 --> 00:10:28.100
Patamon Evolution!

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:33.000
Pegasmon!

00:10:33.800 --> 00:10:35.760
Rodeo Gallop!

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.220
Taichi-san, go!

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.550
Thanks, Takeru!

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:46.980
Hikari!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:03.120
Hikari!

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:04.970
Hikari!

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:08.370
Stretch out... your hand!

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:16.380
Hikari...

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.030
Magnificent!

00:11:46.530 --> 00:11:49.060
The pulse of Millenniumon's rebirth.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:52.290
The ceremony is now approaching
its final stage.

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:55.420
Its final stage.

00:11:59.010 --> 00:12:01.050
Hikari-chan was swallowed...

00:12:01.510 --> 00:12:03.760
And Darkknightmon's growing further?!

00:12:12.190 --> 00:12:13.230
Taichi!

00:12:19.820 --> 00:12:21.190
There's no time...

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:23.360
to be thinking!

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:27.330
Greymon!

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:28.850
Yeah!

00:12:32.250 --> 00:12:36.170
Greymon Super Evolution!

00:12:42.090 --> 00:12:44.050
Metalgreymon!

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:47.300
I swear we're gonna get Hikari back!

00:13:44.780 --> 00:13:45.990
Hikari!

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:52.180
Birdramon!

00:13:52.180 --> 00:13:54.790
Birdramon Super Evolution!

00:13:55.200 --> 00:13:56.410
Garudamon!

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:02.800
Shadow Wing!

00:14:13.260 --> 00:14:14.750
Pegasmon!

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:17.140
Silver Blaze!

00:14:49.680 --> 00:14:51.840
I'm here.

00:14:52.300 --> 00:14:53.950
Please respond.

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:57.930
You're the one who's been calling me
all this time, aren't you?

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:12.490
That's it.

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:18.250
That power, that life,
offer it all to Millenniumon.

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:20.110
Offer it all.

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:21.330
Offer it all.

00:15:21.710 --> 00:15:23.000
Offer it all.

00:15:34.850 --> 00:15:35.640
What now?!

00:15:36.060 --> 00:15:36.950
Where's Taichi?!

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.790
Oh, there!

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:41.020
<i>Taichi, are you okay?!</i>

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:44.670
<i>Taichi?</i>

00:15:44.670 --> 00:15:47.610
She didn't take my hand.

00:15:48.610 --> 00:15:49.400
But...

00:15:54.030 --> 00:15:56.930
<i>There must be a reason.
She's waiting for me!</i>

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:57.910
Taichi...

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:02.080
Darkknightmon is losing shape

00:16:02.460 --> 00:16:06.090
and is breaking down into data
to be sent somewhere!

00:16:06.540 --> 00:16:07.650
Then...

00:16:07.650 --> 00:16:09.070
<i>Hikari-chan too!</i>

00:16:09.070 --> 00:16:10.420
There's no way...

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.630
I'm gonna let that happen!

00:16:19.100 --> 00:16:21.100
I'm here.

00:16:21.560 --> 00:16:23.140
You're here, aren't you?

00:16:27.440 --> 00:16:28.980
Come over here.

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:33.150
I'll let you out from here.

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:37.490
Since surely, no, definitely...

00:16:38.830 --> 00:16:40.870
<i>He'll come to save us!</i>

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:50.090
Here.

00:16:50.460 --> 00:16:53.590
Take my hand.

00:17:05.690 --> 00:17:07.610
Stretch out your hand!

00:17:13.990 --> 00:17:15.490
Come here!

00:17:35.720 --> 00:17:38.220
Taichi!

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:40.890
Hikari!

00:17:52.190 --> 00:17:57.070
Metalgreymon Mega Evolution!

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:05.680
Wargreymon!

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:13.460
Brave Tornado!

00:18:51.880 --> 00:18:53.170
Taichi!

00:18:53.710 --> 00:18:54.710
Hikari!

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:05.600
Darkknightmon?!

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.880
I told you not to wander off by yourself.

00:19:36.590 --> 00:19:39.010
I came to get you, Hikari.

00:19:40.010 --> 00:19:43.680
I'm sorry, but I believed in you.

00:19:44.050 --> 00:19:46.640
I knew you would definitely come!

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:50.390
Taichi.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:03.840
Shame!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:04.840
Shame!

00:20:04.840 --> 00:20:05.890
Shame!

00:20:05.890 --> 00:20:07.950
But we...

00:20:13.170 --> 00:20:15.940
shall wait for the next opportunity.

00:20:15.940 --> 00:20:17.460
The next opportunity.

00:20:17.800 --> 00:20:19.050
The next opportunity.

00:20:19.380 --> 00:20:21.010
The next opportunity.

00:20:29.310 --> 00:20:30.950
Taichi! Hikari-chan!

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:31.990
Agumon!

00:20:31.990 --> 00:20:33.520
We're back!

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:42.450
So that's where you were...

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:47.050
We finally meet.

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:49.350
I'm Hikari.

00:20:49.350 --> 00:20:51.930
I know. Hikari!

00:20:52.460 --> 00:20:54.580
I've been waiting for you.

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:57.590
I've been waiting for a long, long time!

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:02.300
I am Tailmon!
The Holy Digimon!

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:02.300
TAILMON

00:21:05.970 --> 00:21:07.340
Tailmon!

00:21:09.970 --> 00:21:11.100
Hikari!

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:15.310
Hikari.

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:17.400
Taichi...

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:22.070
Thank you.

00:22:31.050 --> 00:22:32.600
<i>The Digimon Encyclopedia!</i>

00:22:34.100 --> 00:22:35.370
<i>Pegasmon.</i>

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:37.580
<i>This Digimon evolves from Patamon.</i>

00:22:35.470 --> 00:22:37.520
LEVEL: ???

00:22:37.580 --> 00:22:42.610
<i>Pegasmon dashes around the battlefield
in every direction at superspeed!</i>

00:22:37.690 --> 00:22:40.100
TYPE: MAMMAL

00:22:40.270 --> 00:22:42.610
SPECIAL MOVE: RODEO GALLOP
SILVER BLAZE / SHOOTING STAR

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:45.030
<i>Now, let's check this out!</i>

00:22:45.420 --> 00:22:48.880
<i>Enwrapped in sparkling armor,
Pegasmon's very cool now!</i>

00:22:48.880 --> 00:22:50.340
<i>I'm envious!</i>

00:22:50.340 --> 00:22:54.180
<i>When I said that,
Kabuterimon became silent all of a sudden.</i>

00:22:54.180 --> 00:22:55.410
<i>I wonder why?</i>

00:22:57.660 --> 00:22:59.870
<i>Which Digimon will it be next time?</i>

00:23:01.880 --> 00:23:05.110
<i>To protect the world of the sea Digimon,</i>

00:23:05.110 --> 00:23:07.940
<i>Hikari and Tailmon's battle begins.</i>

00:23:07.940 --> 00:23:11.530
<i>Next time on Digimon Adventure:
"Hikari and Tailmon"</i>

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:14.220
<i>The adventure continues to a new world.</i>
